*str* | V-$CHIPVR ($CHIPCN)

''str(value)''

Converts a value to its string representation.

*Parameters:*
- ''value'': Any value to convert

*Returns:*
- String: String representation of the value
  - Number: Formatted as decimal (no locale assumptions)
  - String: Returns the string value unchanged
  - List: Formatted as ''[element1, element2, ...]''
  - Map: Formatted as ''m["key": value, ...]''
  - Bytes: Formatted byte representation
  - Other: Default string representation

*Errors:*
- Runtime error if wrong number of arguments
